{
  "name": "New businesses in your city: owners of recently founded companies into a welcome campaign",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New businesses in your city: owners of recently founded companies into a welcome campaign\n\n### How it works\nNew companies need everything at once: an accountant, insurance, an office, a website. Once a month Argorant counts owners, founders and C-level people at companies founded in or after founded_since (last year by default) based within the radius around your place. If the count is within max_people, they are saved as a list named after the month, which joins your welcome campaign once it has filled (usually a minute or two); people already in it are not added twice. Otherwise nothing is saved or spent.\n\nCosts: free until the list is added, then 1 credit per new person.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Set place, radius_miles and max_people in **Settings**.\n4. Pick the welcome campaign in **Add to the welcome campaign** and activate.\n\n### Customization\nNarrow by industry, or set founded_since to this year for the newest companies only.",
        "height": 636,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "24f41797-d2ca-4a23-945d-c75cb0d7b42b",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
